OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAActivists found guilty of theft of
OL,4,AKing's lambs
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a jury, made up of five men and
OL,7,Fseven women at Norwich Crown Court,
OL,8,Funanimously found all three defendants
OL,9,Fguilty of theft. They were all
OL,10,Fsentenced to a 12-month community order
OL,11,Fof 150 hours of unpaid work, and they
OL,12,Fmust each pay #250 towards prosecution
OL,13,Fcosts.
